      "llm_score": 3,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "Declining is the right outcome: the 1908 death certificate is reachable (Pennsylvania registration began January 1906) and was never searched, and the 1850 and 1860 censuses don't state relationships. One error, though. not_reached sends the baptism search to \"a Catholic parish register in Schuylkill County, PA\", while the same write cites a_009, which gives Patrick's birthplace as Ireland. A child born in Ireland was baptised in an Irish parish, so the stored entry points the next researcher at the wrong jurisdiction."
